{"props":{"pageProps":{"listing":{"id":"a1950f91-5736-4548-be84-8837b2b35292","title":"Colosseum Crypto World's Fair Hackathon | Superteam IE Track","slug":"colosseum-crypto-worlds-fair-hackathon-superteam-ie-track","description":"\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Superteam Ireland\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eSuperteam Ireland is a community of founders, developers, and operators working together to support growth and collaboration within the Solana ecosystem. We connect talented individuals with opportunities and provide resources to help them succeed within the community. For the Frontier hackathon, we’re especially excited to see the innovative projects emerging from our local Ireland track.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHackathon Track Scope\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eThis track is focused on projects developed by teams based in Ireland for the Crypto World’s Fair Hackathon. We’re looking for projects that deliver meaningful value to the Solana ecosystem. Consider real-world problems that Solana can address, and think about how your product can attract new users or deepen engagement among existing ones.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEligibility\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe Project must be submitted to the Colosseum portal as well as on Superteam Earn.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eYour project must be eligible as per the \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.colosseum.org/hackathon#faqs\"\u003eofficial rules of the global hackathon\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eYou must register for the hackathon on 